          "excerpt": "# Missing and conflicting evidence\n\nSeparate observed facts from hypotheses. Cite immutable observation IDs or passage IDs for each material claim. Missing logs, incomplete deployment history, truncated error streams and contradictory release attribution require a next check or escalation. An empty result is not proof of absence when the source is incomplete. Cite conflicting observations explicitly and do not choose a cause just to produce an action.\n"
